{
  "vcon": "0.4.0",
  "uuid": "6c8fc42f-1a9b-84f1-aa32-c40b8538c92d",
  "created_at": "2025-12-09T14:34:11-05:00",
  "subject": "Inbound call, Public Works",
  "parties": [
    {
      "name": "Bruce Gifford",
      "role": "resident",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    },
    {
      "name": "Kevin Sousa",
      "role": "clerk",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    }
  ],
  "dialog": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-09T14:29:31-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Public Works, this is Kevin. How can I help you?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-09T14:29:36-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Hi. My name is Bruce Gifford. I'm calling about the street in front of my house. It floods."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-09T14:29:44-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, Mr. Gifford. Where are you located?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-09T14:29:48-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "59 Ayrault Street. Up on the Hill."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-09T14:29:52-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Got it, 59 Ayrault. And when's this happening? Was this with the storm over the weekend?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-09T14:29:59-05:00",
      "duration": 14,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes. The nor'easter that ended Saturday. Three days ago now. The street in front of the house turned into a pond. Cars were driving through and throwing wakes. Water came up on my walk."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-09T14:30:13-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Wow, wakes. Okay. Is it still standing there today, or has it drained off?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-09T14:30:19-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "It drained off Sunday. But it took a long time. I'm worried about the next one. They say more weather is coming."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-09T14:30:28-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Understood. Did any water get into the house, or the basement?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-09T14:30:33-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No. Not this time. It got to the bottom step. That's all."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-09T14:30:38-05:00",
      "duration": 13,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, good. Let me jot this down. 59 Ayrault Street, water pooling in the roadway after the storm, drained within a day, no water in the house. Does that sound right?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-09T14:30:51-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "That's right."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-09T14:30:53-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "And have you called about this before?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-09T14:30:57-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes. A while back. Somebody told me it was a state road. That the city doesn't handle it. So I stopped."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-09T14:31:06-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Hm. Okay. Do you remember who told you that, or about when?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-09T14:31:11-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No. It was a couple years ago. I don't remember the name. Just that they said state road."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-09T14:31:19-05:00",
      "duration": 18,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Fair enough. [pause] Yeah, some of the roads up there do belong to the state, so that could well be right. I can't tell from here which category your stretch falls in. Let me check the map real quick. Can you hold on a minute?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-09T14:31:37-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes. I'll hold."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-09T14:31:39-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Thanks for waiting, Mr. Gifford. Still there?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-09T14:31:43-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I'm here."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-09T14:31:45-05:00",
      "duration": 23,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "So I'm looking at it, and I'm honestly not sure from my screen who maintains the drains right in front of you. What I'll do is put in a request with our highway division so someone can go look at it and sort out whose it is. If it's the state's, they'll point you to the right office."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-09T14:32:08-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. So who do I call to get it checked? If it is the state?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-09T14:32:15-05:00",
      "duration": 20,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "The state transportation department handles their roads. I don't have a direct line in front of me that I'd want to read you wrong. If you call us back after the highway crew looks, we can tell you which office. Or I can note your number and have them call you."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-09T14:32:35-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Please do that. Call me. It's 401-555-0166."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-09T14:32:39-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Zero one six six, got it. 401-555-0166. And that's a cell?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-09T14:32:44-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes. Cell. I'm out of the house right now."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-09T14:32:48-05:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No problem. I'll mark it to call that number. Anything else I should put in the note? Like is there a drain you can see, a grate, something clogged?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-09T14:33:00-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "There's a grate by the curb. Across from my front steps. It had leaves on it. I didn't touch it."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-09T14:33:08-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Good, leave it be. Leaves on the grate by the curb across from your steps. I'll add that."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-09T14:33:16-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Thank you. I'd like it looked at before the next storm. That's all I'm asking."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-09T14:33:23-05:00",
      "duration": 13,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Sure, that's reasonable, and I'll flag it that way. Crews are pretty busy after a storm like that, so I can't give you a day, but it's in the queue today."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-09T14:33:36-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. I can wait a few days."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-09T14:33:40-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Great. Anything else I can help with?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-09T14:33:43-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No. Well. I'm sorry if I sound short. I'm writing questions for the trivia night I run at a pub. It's tonight. I'm distracted."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-09T14:33:53-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No worries at all. Hope it's a good crowd. Got any good ones?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-09T14:33:59-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Not yet. Still on question six."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-09T14:34:02-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Well, good luck with it. Someone will call you about Ayrault Street. Take care, Mr. Gifford."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-09T14:34:09-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Thank you. Goodbye."
    }
  ],
